# Code owners — deferred since amendment 001 §4, created at M8 (§A.3).
#
# Movo has one contributor today (§E.2: "one contributor" is the honest current state and is
# never to be described as anything else). A single owner is therefore what this file can
# truthfully say. It is written as paths rather than a bare catch-all anyway, because the
# structure is the point: when a second maintainer joins, ownership moves per area rather than
# being re-derived from scratch, and the areas below are the ones where a wrong review is
# expensive rather than merely inconvenient.
#
# Note for whoever adds a team here: a CODEOWNERS entry naming a team that does not exist, or
# that lacks write access, is silently ignored by GitHub — the rule appears to be in force and
# never assigns anyone. Verify the handle resolves after any edit.

*                               @ebubechi-ihediwa

